PRACTICE RULES
==============

1. Try to solve the questions without looking at the solution.
2. Use proper class and function names.
3. Keep data members private wherever possible.
4. Use constructors where required.
5. Use inheritance only when there is a logical relationship.
6. Add comments to explain important parts of your code.
7. Test your program with multiple inputs.
8. Try to make the programs menu-driven where possible.


